config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_UBOOT
	bool "sigmastar-uboot"
	depends on BR2_SOC_VENDOR_SIGMASTAR
	help
	  U-Boot for SigmaStar Infinity6-family SoCs, from OpenIPC's fork of
	  the vendor tree.

	  Builds a NOR boot image (BOOT.bin) into images/ and installs nothing
	  to the target. Producing it does not flash it: the boot partition is
	  the one place on this board where a bad write cannot be recovered in
	  software, so writing it needs a serial console and an SPI flash clip
	  on the bench.

	  A sibling of thingino-uboot rather than a variant of it. That package
	  is Ingenic silicon end to end -- jz_sfc flash controllers, per-SoC
	  isvp_* board defconfigs, a MIPS SPL -- and has no SigmaStar path to
	  extend.

	  https://github.com/openipc/u-boot-sigmastar
